
# Ad-hoc bazel caches created when running bazel from web/ (see root .bazelrc).
.bazel-disk-cache/
.bazelisk/

# Capacitor generated native project (docs/design/ios-support.md §4). The whole
# tree is regenerated by `cap add ios` on the macOS host, so none of it is
# committed. The hand-maintained native config (Info.plist usage strings, etc.)
# lives in the tracked web/ios-config/ and is re-applied to the fresh project by
# the `ios-config` build task. See web/ios-config/README.md.
# Anchored to web/ios so it does NOT also swallow the tracked native plugin
# sources under web/native-plugins/*/ios/ (the wss-bridge cert plugin).
/ios/
